      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ELLIE UNLEASHED (8) has been out of the placings last couple but caught the eye when posting a 19.60 over 352m at this track three starts back. Hot win three back and looks the one to beat here. SOLAR POWER (3) was never in contention last time after losing her position early at Q Straight, but prior to that won by 0.8 lengths at this track (20.00) beating Dodgem Dash in a Grade 6 on July 14. One of the main contenders. WALLOON ROCKET (1) is boxed nicely on the inside. Latest effort finished 4th in a P5 on July 17 over 390m at this track behind Equity beaten 9 lengths (22.51). Looks suited here and can measure up. CLASSIC BOODIE (7) returns from a month layoff in a suitable contest.",
